      "id": "oTTddwzF9TPNkMyd",
      "name": "Accompany",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "oTTddwzF9TPNkMyd",
        "folder": "anixeMDzt4HC67bh",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Accompany",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "reaction"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An ally within 30 feet Casts a Spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You use your performance to supplement an ally's spellcasting, providing magical energy for their spell in their stead. Attempt a @Check[performance] check, using a very high DC for the ally's level, and either spend a Focus Point (if the triggering spell is a focus spell) or expend a spell slot at least 1 rank higher than the triggering spell. If you succeed at your Performance check, your ally's spell doesn't cost the Focus Point or spell slot that ally would normally need to spend.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "bard",
              "concentrate",
              "manipulate"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 8,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
      "fileName": "call-and-response.json",
      "id": "JOq4Xe49A04YycRz",
      "name": "Call and Response",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "JOq4Xe49A04YycRz",
        "folder": "anixeMDzt4HC67bh",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Call and Response",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your composition takes the form of a call-and-response chant that lets your allies continue the effect without you. If your next action is to cast a composition cantrip with a duration of 1 round, it becomes a call. While the spell is active, one ally of your choice affected by the spell can respond to your call as a single action that has the auditory and concentrate traits to extend the spell's duration by 1 round. Only one ally can respond to a given call, and responding to the ally's response has no additional effect.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core"
          },
          "rules": [
            {
              "itemType": "spell",
              "key": "ItemAlteration",
              "mode": "add",
              "predicate": [
                "spellshape:call-and-response"
              ],
              "property": "description",
              "value": [
                {
                  "text": "PF2E.SpecificRule.Spellshape.CallAndResponse"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "RollOption",
              "label": "PF2E.TraitSpellshape",
              "mergeable": true,
              "option": "spellshape",
              "placement": "spellcasting",
              "suboptions": [
                {
                  "label": "{item|name}",
                  "value": "call-and-response"
                }
              ],
              "toggleable": true
            }
          ],
          "traits": {
            "rarity": "common",
            "value": [
              "auditory",
              "bard",
              "concentrate",
              "spellshape"
            ]
          }
        },
        "type": "feat"
      },
      "level": 8,
      "category": "class"
    },
    {
